{"id":"naprimer","lemma":"например","pos":"adv","rank":394,"glosses":["for example, for instance, e.g.","for one"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/2b/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%80.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%80.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Возьмите этот, например.","en":"Take this one, for example.","words":[{"g":"to take","l":"взять"},{"g":"this/that one"},null]},{"text":"«Нам нужно многое сделать». — «Например?»","en":"\"We have a lot of things to do.\" \"Such as?\"","words":[{"g":"(to) us","l":"мы"},{"g":"it is necessary"},{"g":"many things"},{"g":"to make, to do"},null]},{"text":"Что, например, вы бы сделали на моём месте?","en":"For instance, what would you have done if you were in my place?","words":[{"g":"what / that"},null,{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"would"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"},{"g":"on / at"},{"g":"my, mine","l":"мой"},null]},{"text":"Японское слово \"татоэба\" означает \"например\".","en":"The Japanese word \"tatoeba\" means \"for example.\"","words":[{"g":"Japanese","l":"японский"},{"g":"word, term"},null,{"g":"to mean, to signify","l":"означать"},null]},{"text":"\"У нас много дел\". - \"Какие, например?\"","en":"\"We have a lot of things to do.\" \"Such as?\"","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"us","l":"мы"},{"g":"much"},{"g":"to put, to place","l":"деть"},null,null]}]}